ew CodeDesc(\n                    String.valueOf(supplier.getSupplierId()),\n                    supplier.getSupplierName() + \"~\" + supplier.getRegistrationCode() + \"\"\n                ))\n                .collect(Collectors.toList());\n    }\n    @Override\n    public String generateFinancingApplicationNo() {\n        String prefix = \"FA\";\n        String dateTime = DateUtils.getDate(\"yyyyMMddHHmm\");\n        // 查询当前最大流水号\n        Integer maxSeq = pmcFinanceSupplierApplyMapper.selectMaxSequenceByDate(DateUtils.getDate(\"yyyyMMdd\"));\n        int sequence = (maxSeq != null ? maxSeq + 1 : 1);\n        // 确保序列号不超过4位\n        if (sequence > 9999) {\n            sequence = 1;\n        }\n        return String.format(\"%s%s%04d\", prefix, dateTime, sequence);\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public String commonCheckData(PmcFinanceBankBaseQO query, String methodName) {\n        try {\n            log.info(\"执行通用数据校验，方法名：{}，参数类型：{}\", methodName,\n                    query != null ? query.getClass().getSimpleName() : \"null\");\n            switch (methodName) {\n                case \"calculateFinancing\":\n                    return validateCalculateFinancing(query);\n                case \"submitFinancingApply\":\n                    return validateSubmitFinancingApply(query);\n                case \"queryFinancingResult\":\n                    return validateQueryFinancingResult(query);\n                case \"queryFinancingQuota\":\n                    return validateQueryFinancingQuota(query);\n                case \"uploadFinancingAttachment\":\n                case \"supplementFinancingAttachment\":\n                    return validateFileOperation(query);\n                default:\n                    log.warn(\"未知的方法名：{}，执行默认校验\", methodName);\n                    return validateDefault(query);\n            }\n\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            log.error(\"通用数据校验异常，方法名：{}\", methodName, e);\n            return \"数据校验异常：\" + e.getMessage();\n    